---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PostList from "../components/PostList.astro";
import { getPosts } from "../lib";
import { SITE } from "../site";

const recent = (await getPosts()).slice(0, 5);
---

<Base>
  <h2 class="welcome">Welcome</h2>
  <p>
    I'm Alfred, but most people call me Fredo. I'm an operator: I build the
    systems, workflows, and teams that let entrepreneurs and agencies do their
    best work without drowning in it. I write <a href="/writing">letters and
    lessons</a> about operations, agency life, and the unglamorous parts of
    building a business.
  </p>

  <p class="label">present</p>
  <p>
    I run <a href="/work">Fredo's House</a>, where I help founders and
    marketing agencies fix how work actually gets done. I'm also Director of
    Growth at <a href="https://www.ghostnoteagency.com">Ghost Note Agency</a>.
    Currently in {SITE.location}.
  </p>

  <p class="label">past</p>
  <p>
    I started out as a creative project manager and learned quickly that I'm
    not really a project manager. I'm an operator. Fredo's House grew out of
    that.
  </p>

  {
    recent.length > 0 && (
      <>
        <p class="label">recent writing</p>
        <PostList posts={recent} />
        <p style="margin-top:1rem">
          <a href="/writing">All writing →</a>
        </p>
      </>
    )
  }

  <p class="label">say hello</p>
  <p>
    The best way to reach me is <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    If you run a team or an agency and the work feels heavier than it should,
    I'd love to hear about it.
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .welcome {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
